# ========================================
# ===== AUDIT Http =====
# ========================================
# ----- 先执行 02-session.http 登录 -----


### 读取审计日志尾部 (Audit admin / single-admin)
GET {{addr}}/api/admin/audit/logs/audit?tail=200&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 读取安全日志尾部 (Audit admin / single-admin)
GET {{addr}}/api/admin/audit/logs/security?tail=200&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

# ----- SSE 流式握手见 22-sse-push.http -----

### 分页查询执行记录 (Audit admin / single-admin)
GET {{addr}}/api/admin/audit/executions?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 按过滤条件查询执行记录 (Audit admin / single-admin)
GET {{addr}}/api/admin/audit/executions?status=3&limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

# @expect 200,404
### 按 executionId 查询单条执行记录 (Audit admin / single-admin)
GET {{addr}}/api/admin/audit/executions/{{testExecutionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
